  "slug": "chickpea-spinach-skillet",
  "name": "Chickpea and spinach skillet",
  "description": "A fast one-pan dinner of canned chickpeas and spinach, cooked down with garlic and tomato in olive oil and finished with a squeeze of lemon.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Warm the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat, then add the garlic and cook for a minute until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the chickpeas, the chopped tomato and the chili powder, and cook for 5 minutes, pressing some of the chickpeas flat against the skillet.",
    "Add the spinach in handfuls and turn it until just wilted, about 3 minutes.",
    "Squeeze the lemon over everything and serve straight from the skillet."
